{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《自信錄》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云覺明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云覺賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答楊文公書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《决疑集．序》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上觀依報竟，次觀正報。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上七觀觀正報，次觀三輩徃生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮，胡跪，然香，唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "冥心少頃，運想香雲，供養三寶，普熏眾生，咸生淨土。\n禮已，贊云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮已，胡跪然香，一心作是唱言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮已，旋繞稱佛菩薩名號。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或三或七，次向佛前三自皈命。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次至別座誦經念佛，隨意多少，或更回向結撮亦得。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盡此一生，不得一日暫廢。唯將不廢，自要其心得生彼國。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈〔云〕懺主依《華嚴經》所立"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋曰：按此集中行法門有謂經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
